    "title": "Duplin County woman removed as Miss North Carolina USA weeks before national competition - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WITN Web Team ,\n2 hours ago BEULAVILLE, N.C. (WITN) - Just weeks before the Miss USA competition, the woman from Duplin County who was set to represent North Carolina has been stripped of her title. A Blaize Productions, the organization that produces the Miss North Carolina USA pageant, announced Wednesday that it has ended Brittany Boltinhouse’s reign as Miss North Carolina USA 2026. Read full article\n4",
